L000166	        (b) Time evolution of the (time-averaged) imbalance obtained from the SS and GI initial states in \cref{eq_bg_superposition} (dashed red line) and \cref{eq_2siteDW} (solid blue line), respectively, for three different mass-coupling configurations.
